Package: PeakAnnoAgent
Title: Peak Annotation and Pathway Analysis Agent
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Hua", "Huang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "your_email@example.com")
Author: Hua Huang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hua Huang <your_email@example.com>
Description: Analysis engine for the PeakAnnoAgent LLM agent: genomic peak
    QC, ChIPpeakAnno annotation, pathway enrichment, known-motif enrichment,
    and publication-ready figures using ChIPpeakAnno, ChIPseeker, rGREAT,
    HOMER, monaLisa, clusterProfiler, Enrichr, DAVID, g:Profiler,
    WebGestaltR, ReactomePA, MSigDB, and Metascape-friendly exports. A JSON
    tool bridge lets the companion Python agent drive every analysis.
